#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:2
msgid "Auth API"
msgstr "Auth-API"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:4
msgid "This is an explanation of how to use the phpBB auth/acl API."
msgstr "Dette er en forklaring på, hvordan man bruger phpBB's auth/acl-API."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:11
msgid "1. Introduction"
msgstr "1. Introduktion"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:14
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "Hvad er det?"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:16
msgid ""
"The ``auth`` class contains methods related to authorisation of users to "
"access various board functions, e.g., posting, viewing, replying, logging in"
" (and out), etc. If you need to check whether a user can carry out a task or"
" handle user login/logouts, this class is required."
msgstr ""
"Klassen ``auth`` indeholder metoder relateret til autorisation af brugere "
"til at få adgang til forskellige forumfunktioner, f.eks. skrive indlæg, se, "
"svare, logge ind (og ud) osv. Hvis du skal kontrollere, om en bruger kan "
"udføre en opgave, eller håndtere brugerlogin/logout, er denne klasse "
"påkrævet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:19
msgid "Initialisation"
msgstr "Initialisering"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:21
msgid ""
"To use any methods contained within the ``auth`` class, it first needs to be"
" instantiated. This is best achieved early in the execution of the script in"
" the following manner:"
msgstr ""
"For at bruge nogen af metoderne i klassen ``auth`` skal den først "
"instantieres. Dette gøres bedst tidligt i scriptets udførelse på følgende "
"måde:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:27
msgid ""
"Once an instance of the class has been created you are free to call the "
"various methods it contains. Note: if you wish to use the ``auth_admin`` "
"methods you will need to instantiate this separately in the same way."
msgstr ""
"Når en instans af klassen er oprettet, kan du frit kalde de forskellige "
"metoder, den indeholder. Bemærk: hvis du ønsker at bruge "
"``auth_admin``-metoderne, skal du instantiere denne separat på samme måde."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:30
msgid "2. Methods"
msgstr "2. Metoder"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:32
msgid "Following are the methods you are able to use."
msgstr "Følgende er de metoder, du kan bruge."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:35
msgid "2.i. acl"
msgstr "2.i. acl"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:37
msgid ""
"The ``acl`` method is the initialisation routine for all the ACL functions. "
"It must be called before any ACL method. It takes one parameter: an "
"associative array containing user information."
msgstr ""
"Metoden ``acl`` er initialiseringsrutinen for alle ACL-funktioner. Den skal "
"kaldes før enhver anden ACL-metode. Den tager én parameter: et associativt "
"array indeholdende brugeroplysninger."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:43
msgid ""
"Where ``$userdata`` includes at least: ``user_id``, ``user_permissions``, "
"and ``user_type``."
msgstr ""
"Hvor ``$userdata`` mindst indeholder: ``user_id``, ``user_permissions`` og "
"``user_type``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:46
msgid "2.ii. acl_get"
msgstr "2.ii. acl_get"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:48
msgid ""
"This method determines if a user can perform an action either globally or in"
" a specific forum."
msgstr ""
"Denne metode afgør, om en bruger kan udføre en handling, enten globalt eller"
" i et specifikt forum."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:54
msgid ""
"``option``: e.g., 'f_list', 'm_edit', 'a_adduser', etc. Use ``!option`` to "
"negate."
msgstr ""
"``option``: f.eks. 'f_list', 'm_edit', 'a_adduser' osv. Brug ``!option`` for"
" at negere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:55
msgid "``forum`` (optional): integer ``forum_id``."
msgstr "``forum`` (valgfri): heltal ``forum_id``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:57
msgid "Returns a positive integer if allowed, zero if denied."
msgstr "Returnerer et positivt heltal, hvis tilladt, nul hvis afvist."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:60
msgid "2.iii. acl_gets"
msgstr "2.iii. acl_gets"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:62
msgid "This method checks multiple permissions at once."
msgstr "Denne metode kontrollerer flere tilladelser på én gang."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:68
msgid "Returns a positive integer if *any* of the permissions is granted."
msgstr ""
"Returnerer et positivt heltal, hvis *en eller flere* af tilladelserne er "
"givet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:71
msgid "2.iv. acl_getf"
msgstr "2.iv. acl_getf"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:73
msgid "This method checks in which forums a user has a certain permission."
msgstr ""
"Denne metode kontrollerer, i hvilke fora en bruger har en bestemt "
"tilladelse."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:79
msgid "``option``: permission string (negation with ``!`` allowed)"
msgstr "``option``: tilladelsesstreng (negation med ``!`` tilladt)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:80
msgid ""
"``clean``: boolean. If true, only forums where permission is granted are "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"``clean``: boolesk. Hvis true, returneres kun fora, hvor tilladelsen er "
"givet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:82
msgid "Returns an associative array:"
msgstr "Returnerer et associativt array:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:89
msgid "2.v. acl_getf_global"
msgstr "2.v. acl_getf_global"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:91
msgid "Checks if a user has a permission globally or in at least one forum."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerer, om en bruger har en tilladelse globalt eller i mindst ét "
"forum."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:97
msgid "Returns a positive integer or zero."
msgstr "Returnerer et positivt heltal eller nul."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:100
msgid "2.vi. acl_cache"
msgstr "2.vi. acl_cache"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:102
msgid ""
"**Private method.** Automatically called when needed. Generates "
"user_permissions data."
msgstr ""
"**Privat metode.** Kaldes automatisk efter behov. Genererer "
"user_permissions-data."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:105
msgid "2.vii. acl_clear_prefetch"
msgstr "2.vii. acl_clear_prefetch"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:107
msgid "Clears the ``user_permissions`` column in the users table."
msgstr "Rydder kolonnen ``user_permissions`` i brugertabellen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:114
msgid "Use ``$user_id = 0`` to clear cache for all users. Returns null."
msgstr ""
"Brug ``$user_id = 0`` for at rydde cachen for alle brugere. Returnerer null."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:117
msgid "2.viii. acl_get_list"
msgstr "2.viii. acl_get_list"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:119
msgid ""
"Returns an array describing which users have which permissions in which "
"forums."
msgstr ""
"Returnerer et array, der beskriver, hvilke brugere der har hvilke "
"tilladelser i hvilke fora."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:128
msgid ""
"Parameter types: - ``$user_id``: ``false``, int, or array of int - "
"``$permissions``: ``false``, string, or array of string - ``$forum_id``: "
"``false``, int, or array of int"
msgstr ""
"Parametertyper: - ``$user_id``: ``false``, int eller array af int - "
"``$permissions``: ``false``, streng eller array af strenge - ``$forum_id``: "
"``false``, int eller array af int"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:134
msgid "2.ix. Miscellaneous"
msgstr "2.ix. Diverse"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:136
msgid "Additional methods for pulling raw permission data:"
msgstr "Yderligere metoder til at hente rå tilladelsesdata:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:146
msgid ""
"Use ``acl_raw_data`` for general queries; others are optimized for specific "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Brug ``acl_raw_data`` til generelle forespørgsler; de øvrige er optimeret "
"til specifikke data."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:149
msgid "3. Admin Related Functions"
msgstr "3. Administratorrelaterede funktioner"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:151
msgid ""
"Additional methods are available within the ``auth_admin`` class for "
"managing permissions, options, and user cache. It is found in:"
msgstr ""
"Yderligere metoder er tilgængelige i klassen ``auth_admin`` til håndtering "
"af tilladelser, indstillinger og brugercache. Den findes i:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:157
msgid "Instantiate separately:"
msgstr "Instantiér separat:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/auth/authentication.rst:163
msgid "This gives access to both ``auth_admin`` and ``auth`` methods."
msgstr "Dette giver adgang til både ``auth_admin``- og ``auth``-metoder."
